{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22452","headline":"庭槐 · 白居易","name":"庭槐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南方饶竹树，唯有青槐稀。\n十种七八死，纵活亦支离。\n何此郡庭下，一株独华滋。\n蒙蒙碧烟叶，嫋嫋黄花枝。\n我家渭水上，此树荫前墀。\n忽向天涯见，忆在故园时。\n人生有情感，遇物牵所思。\n树木犹复尔，况见旧亲知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22452.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22452","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}